# Project style (owner decision 2026-08-16): 2-space LLVM, matching the
# CubeIDE-generated majority. The 4-space first-party files were reformatted
# once in the style-unification commit; changed lines are hard-gated by
# tools/check_format.sh (CI hygiene job).
# ColumnLimit 0: no rewrapping - the gate enforces indentation/structure,
# not line length (long comment blocks are intentional).
# DerivePointerAlignment false: `char *p` vs `char* p` left as written.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 0
DerivePointerAlignment: false
